{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836036",
      "title": "Dynamic & Conditional Styling with Styled Components",
      "sourceHash": "472236c3a73d53db008ca6f947bd12653f2c988f8e89aadc39139e86d5a1435a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.05,
          "end": 2.46,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.46,
          "end": 5.67,
          "en": "the general idea behind styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.67,
          "end": 7.56,
          "en": "hopefully is clear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.56,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "In the end, it's all about building these small wrappers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "which you can then use in your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "and which you of course also can reuse.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 20.763,
          "en": "And that's the advantage compared to inline styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.41,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "The styles now are closer to the JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "but they are not inside of the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "and we got no duplication in the JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "Instead, we just get these little wrapper components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.993,
          "en": "that we built with help of styled components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "But what about setting styles dynamically or conditionally?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "Because at the moment this conditional styling we got here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 53.73,
          "en": "is still coming from these CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.73,
          "end": 55.503,
          "en": "being added conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.94,
          "end": 58.41,
          "en": "And as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 62.22,
          "en": "even though you can blend styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.22,
          "end": 65.76,
          "en": "and vanilla CSS as we're doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "you will typically go for one solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 73.44,
          "en": "which you then use for everything in your React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.44,
          "end": 76.5,
          "en": "And therefore, typically we don't want to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.5,
          "end": 80.10300000000001,
          "en": "CSS classes like this if we're using styled components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "So how can we now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 87.453,
          "en": "that this still is styled conditionally?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 91.77,
          "en": "Well, for this we could add a special prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "maybe a invalid prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 95.72999999999999,
          "en": "the name is up to you because in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.72999999999999,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "it's still your component even though it's created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 100.233,
          "en": "with help of styled components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.52000000000001,
          "end": 105.18,
          "en": "And then you can add any value you want to that prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.18,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "For example here the value stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.703,
          "en": "in this emailNotValid constant here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "This value in here, as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 118.77000000000001,
          "en": "will be true or false, and therefore it's now true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.77000000000001,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "that set as a value on the invalid prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 123.363,
          "en": "on this label component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.4,
          "end": 127.41,
          "en": "And now with styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.41,
          "end": 132.3,
          "en": "you can use props set like this inside of your styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.393,
          "en": "to dynamically alter those styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 138.84,
          "en": "Now for that, let's take a brief look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.84,
          "end": 143.84,
          "en": "at the label.invalid class and let's see what it does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.94,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "And as you can see, what it does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 150.153,
          "en": "is that it changes the color to this reddish color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 153.93,
          "en": "So we can therefore grab that color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.93,
          "end": 158.04,
          "en": "and back in the styled component, this styled label here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 161.19299999999998,
          "en": "we wanna set this color value dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.18,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "And we can achieve this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 167.91,
          "en": "by now using this special injection syntax again here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 170.46,
          "en": "which you can use between these back ticks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 173.463,
          "en": "to construct a dynamic string in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.54,
          "end": 177.09,
          "en": "And with styled components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.09,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "you can and should now pass a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 184.293,
          "en": "for example such an arrow function as a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.55,
          "end": 189.6,
          "en": "because values you inject into this string here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.6,
          "end": 194.6,
          "en": "will in the end be picked up by that label function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.91,
          "end": 198.45,
          "en": "that's defined by the styled components package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.45,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "and will be executed and handled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "by that styled components package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 207.87,
          "en": "That's how these tagged templates work in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.87,
          "end": 210.32999999999998,
          "en": "If you inject dynamic values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.32999999999998,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "those tagged template functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 216.543,
          "en": "will receive those injected values as arguments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.601,
          "end": 220.74,
          "en": "So therefore this will be a function that will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.74,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "by the styled components package in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 227.91,
          "en": "And this styled component package will execute this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 230.61,
          "en": "to dynamically derive a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.61,
          "end": 233.793,
          "en": "that should be used in this place in our styling rules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 234.75,
          "end": 238.23,
          "en": "And to help us derive a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 238.23,
          "end": 242.52,
          "en": "the styled components package will give us the props object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 246.033,
          "en": "as an input to this function, which it will execute for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.53,
          "end": 249.87,
          "en": "And this of course will include all the props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.87,
          "end": 252.27,
          "en": "that are set on that styled component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.27,
          "end": 254.643,
          "en": "for example, this invalid prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.29,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "Therefore, to return the value that should be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 263.94,
          "en": "by the styled components package in this place here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.94,
          "end": 267.55,
          "en": "we can now take a look at props.invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 267.55,
          "end": 271.32,
          "en": "or of course also use destructuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.32,
          "end": 272.823,
          "en": "and use invalid like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.02,
          "end": 278.58299999999997,
          "en": "and then either if this is true, set this reddish color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 284.343,
          "en": "or if this is false, use this color, this default color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 287.15999999999997,
          "end": 289.74,
          "en": "And with that we got all these styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.74,
          "end": 292.98,
          "en": "hard coded and set up permanently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 292.98,
          "end": 296.04,
          "en": "but this style is now derived dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 296.04,
          "end": 297.513,
          "en": "based on our props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 299.28,
          "end": 303.39,
          "en": "And therefore if we reload this and I click SIGN IN,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 303.39,
          "end": 307.293,
          "en": "you see this label still is styled conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 309.96,
          "en": "but this is now happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 309.96,
          "end": 312.543,
          "en": "because of our stalled components code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 316.35,
          "en": "Because that className was removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 316.35,
          "end": 318.27,
          "en": "so that's not causing that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 318.27,
          "end": 321.21,
          "en": "instead it's this newly added prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 321.21,
          "end": 324.453,
          "en": "and this styled components feature being used here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 325.29,
          "end": 327.81,
          "en": "And whilst this might look strange at first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 327.81,
          "end": 330.54,
          "en": "it's really straightforward to get into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.54,
          "end": 332.43,
          "en": "and this is therefore how you can style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 332.43,
          "end": 334.503,
          "en": "your styled components conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 336.09000000000003,
          "end": 339.24,
          "en": "Now feel free to, as a practice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.24,
          "end": 342.75,
          "en": "also add some conditional styling to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.75,
          "end": 345.03,
          "en": "After a short pause, which I'll give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.03,
          "end": 347.64,
          "en": "to pause the video and try this on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.64,
          "end": 349.14300000000003,
          "en": "we'll do it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.49,
          "end": 356.07,
          "en": "So let's now add these conditional styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 356.07,
          "end": 358.14,
          "en": "to this input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.14,
          "end": 360.57,
          "en": "For that, we first of all wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 360.57,
          "end": 364.05,
          "en": "that we get a prop that tells us if this is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.05,
          "end": 365.49,
          "en": "And for that we can of course use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 365.49,
          "end": 368.433,
          "en": "the same invalid prop I used on my label here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.99,
          "end": 373.56,
          "en": "So now inside of the styled input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 373.56,
          "end": 377.43,
          "en": "we can use this invalid prop with this syntax here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.43,
          "end": 379.353,
          "en": "just as we did it for the label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 380.91,
          "end": 382.95,
          "en": "So let's take a look at which styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 382.95,
          "end": 387.21,
          "en": "should be applied conditionally here to the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 387.21,
          "end": 391.14,
          "en": "And here you can see that it's these three CSS properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 391.14,
          "end": 394.173,
          "en": "that are set if the invalid class is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 395.90999999999997,
          "end": 398.61,
          "en": "So color, border color and background color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 398.61,
          "end": 400.83299999999997,
          "en": "we wanna set those dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 401.7,
          "end": 404.1,
          "en": "Hence here in this styled input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 404.1,
          "end": 406.53,
          "en": "we can go to the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 406.53,
          "end": 410.963,
          "en": "and use this injection syntax where we get our props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 412.59000000000003,
          "end": 414.09000000000003,
          "en": "or we use destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 414.09000000000003,
          "end": 416.613,
          "en": "to get direct access to the invalid prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.78,
          "end": 420.483,
          "en": "And if invalid is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 421.38,
          "end": 424.5,
          "en": "we want to use this background color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 424.5,
          "end": 429.333,
          "en": "So I'll copy that and use this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 430.86,
          "end": 433.323,
          "en": "otherwise it's this color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 436.41,
          "end": 440.043,
          "en": "And of course we have to check if invalid is true first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 442.59,
          "end": 444.63,
          "en": "So that was the background color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 444.63,
          "end": 446.46,
          "en": "now for the text color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 446.46,
          "end": 449.1,
          "en": "we also have a special color that should be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 449.1,
          "end": 454.1,
          "en": "if the input is invalid and therefore I'll copy that color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 454.5,
          "end": 457.89,
          "en": "and then here we do exactly the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 457.89,
          "end": 459.78,
          "en": "We get the invalid prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 459.78,
          "end": 462.09000000000003,
          "en": "because we're getting all props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 462.09000000000003,
          "end": 465.12,
          "en": "I check if invalid is truthy, and if that's the case",
