        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 517.44,
          "end": 522.09,
          "en": "for label and input to apply dynamic styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 522.09,
          "end": 523.98,
          "en": "And we can now also do this down here",
